{"5028150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sarco", "steam_appid": 5028150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE A STARING CONTEST WITH THE SARCOPHAGUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something ancient and powerful is sealed inside a sarcophagus at the heart of an abandoned research complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/8949d628ebc89ed13c556c9d7741adf7.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/8949d628ebc89ed13c556c9d7741adf7.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/8949d628ebc89ed13c556c9d7741adf7.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you <strong>maintain visual contact</strong>, it remains closed. Look away, and the sarcophagus slowly begins to open. If it opens completely, the primordial being within will break free, and you will become a thing of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCHING IT KEEPS YOU ALIVE. IT DOESN’T SOLVE THE PROBLEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sarcophagus cannot be watched forever. Not least because you’re <strong>running out of oxygen</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/205b6d91a609758506c6bee0512ee675.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/205b6d91a609758506c6bee0512ee675.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/205b6d91a609758506c6bee0512ee675.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere within the deserted corridors lies a way to stop the being for good. To find it, you must leave the chamber behind and venture deeper into the complex, all while finding <strong>ways to keep the sarcophagus closed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step away is a risk. Every return may reveal that something has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE THING WITHIN WILL ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/cb9692cf61004dc2916d63ac1e254c29.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/cb9692cf61004dc2916d63ac1e254c29.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/cb9692cf61004dc2916d63ac1e254c29.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual contact is only a temporary solution. The being is not passive. <strong>It will adapt</strong>, forcing you to abandon familiar routines and find new routes. Understanding its behavior may be the only way to survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONSTANT TENSION, NO REST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sarco</strong> builds its horror around a <strong>persistent</strong>, <strong>visible threat</strong> rather than sudden scripted shocks. You know where the danger is. You know how to delay it temporarily. The tension comes from knowing that you cannot keep watching forever. Both your time and resources are severely limited while <strong>your enemy grows stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/ed73b3415d7b8bf0af0a941a62a2dc3c.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/ed73b3415d7b8bf0af0a941a62a2dc3c.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/ed73b3415d7b8bf0af0a941a62a2dc3c.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sarco cannot be paused or saved and must be completed in a single sitting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON’T LET IT OPEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/e3f3f04c8ff2a4fc2089918abe76962a.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/e3f3f04c8ff2a4fc2089918abe76962a.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/e3f3f04c8ff2a4fc2089918abe76962a.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain visual contact. Explore the complex. Find a permanent solution.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE A STARING CONTEST WITH THE SARCOPHAGUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something ancient and powerful is sealed inside a sarcophagus at the heart of an abandoned research complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/8949d628ebc89ed13c556c9d7741adf7.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/8949d628ebc89ed13c556c9d7741adf7.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/8949d628ebc89ed13c556c9d7741adf7.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you <strong>maintain visual contact</strong>, it remains closed. Look away, and the sarcophagus slowly begins to open. If it opens completely, the primordial being within will break free, and you will become a thing of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCHING IT KEEPS YOU ALIVE. IT DOESN’T SOLVE THE PROBLEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sarcophagus cannot be watched forever. Not least because you’re <strong>running out of oxygen</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/205b6d91a609758506c6bee0512ee675.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/205b6d91a609758506c6bee0512ee675.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/205b6d91a609758506c6bee0512ee675.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere within the deserted corridors lies a way to stop the being for good. To find it, you must leave the chamber behind and venture deeper into the complex, all while finding <strong>ways to keep the sarcophagus closed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step away is a risk. Every return may reveal that something has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE THING WITHIN WILL ADAPT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/cb9692cf61004dc2916d63ac1e254c29.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/cb9692cf61004dc2916d63ac1e254c29.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/cb9692cf61004dc2916d63ac1e254c29.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual contact is only a temporary solution. The being is not passive. <strong>It will adapt</strong>, forcing you to abandon familiar routines and find new routes. Understanding its behavior may be the only way to survive it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONSTANT TENSION, NO REST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sarco</strong> builds its horror around a <strong>persistent</strong>, <strong>visible threat</strong> rather than sudden scripted shocks. You know where the danger is. You know how to delay it temporarily. The tension comes from knowing that you cannot keep watching forever. Both your time and resources are severely limited while <strong>your enemy grows stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/ed73b3415d7b8bf0af0a941a62a2dc3c.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/ed73b3415d7b8bf0af0a941a62a2dc3c.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/ed73b3415d7b8bf0af0a941a62a2dc3c.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sarco cannot be paused or saved and must be completed in a single sitting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON’T LET IT OPEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/e3f3f04c8ff2a4fc2089918abe76962a.poster.avif?t=1787528289\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/e3f3f04c8ff2a4fc2089918abe76962a.webm?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/extras/e3f3f04c8ff2a4fc2089918abe76962a.mp4?t=1787528289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain visual contact. Explore the complex. Find a permanent solution.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Sarco is a first-person horror game built around constant tension instead of jump scares. Maintain visual contact with the sarcophagus to keep it closed and the primordial being contained. But beware: it will adapt. Explore an abandoned complex and find a way to stop the being before it breaks free.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/a56428395078203eee4590653823656133a43e9c/header.jpg?t=1787528289", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/adac814798db736b512e30032e431c50b4ce1023/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787528289", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028150/adac814798db736b512e30032e431c50b4ce1023/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787528289", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Потребує 64-бітних процесора та операційної системи</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Потребує 64-бітних процесора та операційної системи</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Hello Andromeda"], "publishers": ["Hello Andromeda"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "des